oss 6 grids. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, September to October came in under 90% of normal in 34 years, the most of any pair, and Nov-Dec did it in 26. In 2025 the middle ran 179% of normal in May to June and 58% in August to September. Grid 23605 had its driest year in 1991 at 73% of normal.</p>"}
